      "text": "♥️ 全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜!✨\nA Peaceful Greetings to Humanity!✨\n\nThe bloom of YANASHI began in the vibrant heart of the Philippines — Full of Color, Passion and Dreams.✨\n\nLife paused it when I arrived in Japan 2012. I thought it was all forgotten. ✨\n\nYear 2023, YANASHI officially registered in Japan. Reborn, Stronger, Deeper and Full of Light. ✨\n\nDifferent Soil. Same Roots. Stronger Stem. ✨\n\nPhilippines gave it Soul and Fire 🔥\nJapan established its Structure, Patience and Space to fully bloom.  With Deepest Gratitude, Love, Peace and Joy. The journey continues ♥️\n\n全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜! From PH to JP 🇯🇵\nThe Bloom of YANASHI is here. ✨\n\n#YANASHI #YANASHIJapan #Gratitude #感謝",
